r Straight sequence (10-10-J-J-Q-Q).\n2. It preserves the Triple 4s (♥4 ♣4 ♦4) and the single King, allowing for a Triple with Single play later.\n3. It keeps the top Pair of 2s (♠2 ♣2) for control.\nThis line of play transforms a hand with scattered singles into a structured set of combinations (Straight, Pair Straight, Triple with Kicker, Pairs), drastically increasing the chances of clearing the hand quickly.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠5", "♠6", "♠7", "♣8", "♥9", "♥10"]}'}
